# Copy to .env.local if you need to override anything. .env.local is git-ignored.
#
# YOU PROBABLY NEED NOTHING HERE.
#
# `vite.config.ts` proxies `/api` to the API in development, so the app talks to
# its own origin and `BASE_URL` falls back to `window.location.origin`. That is
# not a convenience: the API has no CORS policy, so a direct cross-origin call is
# blocked at preflight and never reaches it.
#
# Set this ONLY for a deployment where the API is genuinely on another origin —
# which is also the deployment that needs a CORS policy first.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# To point the PROXY at an API on another port, set this instead. Read by
# vite.config.ts, never by the app. The default is http://localhost:5272, which is
# what src/Wasl.Api/Properties/launchSettings.json binds (confirmed 2026-08-27;
# the 5000 this file used to guess was spec Q-4 and was wrong).
# WASL_API_TARGET=http://localhost:5272
